# Profiles from Home: a new one made from the install The game lists first,
# named Mod test on Your profile, the one in use after; the first profile
# duplicated, the copy renamed Copy, its name's whole edit undone once by
# Esc, then deleted to the trash; the first used again by its row.
wait 1
expect home
find Profiles
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
find New profile...
key Return
wait 0.5
expect find
key Return
wait 0.5
expect import
find Name
type Mod test
key Return
wait 0.3
find Make the profile
key Return
wait 0.8
expect home
find Profiles
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
find Deus Ex
find Duplicate
key Return
wait 0.5
find Name
type Wrong
key Escape
wait 0.3
type Copy
key Return
wait 0.3
find Delete...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect confirm
find Delete
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
find Deus Ex
key Return
wait 0.5
expect home
quit
